    "productDescriptionProps": {
      "paragraphs": [
        "This sofa bed has a neat, playful and versatile design with rounded shapes and generously sized back cushions that provide comfort and make it feel inviting.",
        "You can easily create a single bed by keeping the pouffe connected to the seat and simply removing the back cushions.",
        "The sofa bed offers practical storage spaces both under the seat section and in the pouffe.",
        "The pouffe can be detached from the seating section and, for example, be used as a flexible extra seat or a coffee table.",
        "The cover is made from Vissle dope-dyed fabric in polyester – a durable material with a smooth weave and a nice two-tone effect.",
        "The cover has been treated with easy-care, which means that spills won’t seep into the fabric, but stay on the surface and are easily absorbed with a dry cloth.",
        "10-year limited warranty. Read about the terms in the limited warranty brochure."
      ],
